<section class="enc-words" id="in-their-words"><h2 class="enc-section-title">In their words</h2><blockquote class="enc-q"><p>&#8220;What an artist is now about to perish!&#8221;</p><footer>Suetonius, Life of Nero, 49 &#183; tr. Alexander Thomson, 1796, rev. T. Forester &#183; as his grave was dug, 68 CE; Suetonius' account &#183; <a href="https://www.gutenberg.org/cache/epub/6400/pg6400-images.html" rel="noopener">Project Gutenberg</a></footer></blockquote><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/encyclopedia/quotations">Quotations from 595 people &rarr;</a></p></section>
